    {
      "@id": "concept:c2004a03367-sec-5-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "5(2) Section 5",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2004a03367#sec-5-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2004a03367.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2004a03367.pdf, p.5",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Subject to sub-section (3), a reference in the Commission Act, or in\nany other enactment, to an act or thing done by or to, or an instrument\nmade by or given to, the Commission, a member of the Commission, or a\nMinister, under a provision of the Commission Act shall be read as including\na reference to an act or thing done by or to, or an instrument made by or\ngiven to, the former Commission, a member of the former Commission, or\na Minister, as the case may be, before the commencement time, under the\ncorresponding provision of the repealed Act.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Subject to sub-section (3), a reference in the Commission Act, or in\nany other enactment, to an act or thing done by or to, or an instrument\nmade by or given to, the Commission, a member of the Commission, or a\nMinister, under a provision of the Commission Act shall be read as including\na reference to an act or thing done by or to, or an instrument made by or\ngiven to, the former Commission, a member of the former Commission, or\na Minister, as the case may be, before the commencement time, under the\ncorresponding provision of the repealed Act.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2004a03367-sec-5"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2004a03367-sec-5-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2004a03367-sec-5-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "fe9fe9fce072ee76174d9f2253dbe38f24920a8f06f41d05ec0ead925546ac5a",
      "skos:note": "Reference to Commission Act includes reference to former Commission before commencement time."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2004a03367#sec-5-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "5(2) Section 5",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 5,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Subject to sub-section (3), a reference in the Commission Act, or in\nany other enactment, to an act or thing done by or to, or an instrument\nmade by or given to, the Commission, a member of the Commission, or a\nMinister, under a provision of the Commission Act shall be read as including\na reference to an act or thing done by or to, or an instrument made by or\ngiven to, the former Commission, a member of the former Commission, or\na Minister, as the case may be, before the commencement time, under the\ncorresponding provision of the repealed Act."
    },
