      "values:originalText": "section 34 of the repealed Act continue to operate in relation to a person\nwho, immediately before the commencement time, was a person to whom\nthat section applied.\nTransfer of funds",
      "skos:definition": "section 34 of the repealed Act continue to operate in relation to a person\nwho, immediately before the commencement time, was a person to whom\nthat section applied.\nTransfer of funds",
