    {
      "@id": "concept:c2004a03367-sec-12",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "12 Section 12",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2004a03367#sec-12"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2004a03367.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2004a03367.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "Section 3 of the Principal Act is amended—\n(a) by omitting from sub-section (1) the definition of \"Commissioner\"\nand substituting the following definitions:\n\"'Commission' means the Human Rights and Equal Opportunity\nCommission established by the Human\nRights\nand\nEqual\nOpportunity\nCommission\nAct 1986;\n'Commissioner' means the Race Discrimination Commissioner\nappointed under section 29;\";\n(b) by omitting from sub-section (1) the definition of \"Human Rights\nCommission\" and substituting the following definition:\n\"'Federal Court' means the Federal Court of Australia;\"; and\n(c) by inserting after the definition of \"member\" in sub-section (1) the\nfollowing definition:\n\"'registered organisation' means an organisation registered pursuant\nto the Conciliation\nand Arbitration\nAct\n1904;\".",
      "skos:definition": "Section 3 of the Principal Act is amended—\n(a) by omitting from sub-section (1) the definition of \"Commissioner\"\nand substituting the following definitions:\n\"'Commission' means the Human Rights and Equal Opportunity\nCommission established by the Human\nRights\nand\nEqual\nOpportunity\nCommission\nAct 1986;\n'Commissioner' means the Race Discrimination Commissioner\nappointed under section 29;\";\n(b) by omitting from sub-section (1) the definition of \"Human Rights\nCommission\" and substituting the following definition:\n\"'Federal Court' means the Federal Court of Australia;\"; and\n(c) by inserting after the definition of \"member\" in sub-section (1) the\nfollowing definition:\n\"'registered organisation' means an organisation registered pursuant\nto the Conciliation\nand Arbitration\nAct\n1904;\".",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2004a03367-sec-12-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6530ecafd10d20a149b4cdb262eb55bfb171b252450bc1f6fc78c73d240e2840",
      "skos:note": "Amends definitions in Section 3 of the Principal Act."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2004a03367#sec-12",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "12 Section 12",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 7,
      "values:originalText": "Section 3 of the Principal Act is amended—\n(a) by omitting from sub-section (1) the definition of \"Commissioner\"\nand substituting the following definitions:\n\"'Commission' means the Human Rights and Equal Opportunity\nCommission established by the Human\nRights\nand\nEqual\nOpportunity\nCommission\nAct 1986;\n'Commissioner' means the Race Discrimination Commissioner\nappointed under section 29;\";\n(b) by omitting from sub-section (1) the definition of \"Human Rights\nCommission\" and substituting the following definition:\n\"'Federal Court' means the Federal Court of Australia;\"; and\n(c) by inserting after the definition of \"member\" in sub-section (1) the\nfollowing definition:\n\"'registered organisation' means an organisation registered pursuant\nto the Conciliation\nand Arbitration\nAct\n1904;\"."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2004a03367-sec-12-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
