      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2004a03367-sec-13",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "13 Section 13",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2004a03367#sec-13"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2004a03367.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2004a03367.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "Section 6 of the Principal Act is repealed and the following section\nis substituted:\n\nHuman Rights and Equal Opportunity Commission\n(Transitional\nProvisions and Consequential Amendments)\nNo. 126, 1986\n\"PART III—INQUIRIES AND CIVIL PROCEEDINGS\n\"Division 1—Preliminary\nRace Discrimination Commissioner\n\"19. For the purposes of this Act there shall be a Race Discrimination\nCommissioner.\nFunctions of Commission\n\"20. (1) The\nfollowing\nfunctions\nare\nhereby\nconferred\non\nthe\nCommission:\n(a) to inquire into alleged infringements of Part II, and endeavour by\nconciliation to effect settlements of the matters alleged to constitute\nthose infringements;\nAct binds the Crown\n\"6. This Act binds the Crown in right of the Commonwealth, of each\nof the States, of the Northern Territory and of Norfolk Island, but nothing\nin this Act renders the Crown liable to be prosecuted for an offence.\".\nLand, housing and other accommodation",
      "skos:definition": "Section 6 of the Principal Act is repealed and the following section\nis substituted:\n\nHuman Rights and Equal Opportunity Commission\n(Transitional\nProvisions and Consequential Amendments)\nNo. 126, 1986\n\"PART III—INQUIRIES AND CIVIL PROCEEDINGS\n\"Division 1—Preliminary\nRace Discrimination Commissioner\n\"19. For the purposes of this Act there shall be a Race Discrimination\nCommissioner.\nFunctions of Commission\n\"20. (1) The\nfollowing\nfunctions\nare\nhereby\nconferred\non\nthe\nCommission:\n(a) to inquire into alleged infringements of Part II, and endeavour by\nconciliation to effect settlements of the matters alleged to constitute\nthose infringements;\nAct binds the Crown\n\"6. This Act binds the Crown in right of the Commonwealth, of each\nof the States, of the Northern Territory and of Norfolk Island, but nothing\nin this Act renders the Crown liable to be prosecuted for an offence.\".\nLand, housing and other accommodation",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2004a03367-sec-13-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b1c086fb5d429622650551ce560a5850387cbf30011af7e05f073871fce4323b",
      "skos:note": "Repeals Section 6 of the Principal Act and substitutes a new section."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2004a03367#sec-13",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "13 Section 13",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 7,
      "values:originalText": "Section 6 of the Principal Act is repealed and the following section\nis substituted:\n\nHuman Rights and Equal Opportunity Commission\n(Transitional\nProvisions and Consequential Amendments)\nNo. 126, 1986\n\"PART III—INQUIRIES AND CIVIL PROCEEDINGS\n\"Division 1—Preliminary\nRace Discrimination Commissioner\n\"19. For the purposes of this Act there shall be a Race Discrimination\nCommissioner.\nFunctions of Commission\n\"20. (1) The\nfollowing\nfunctions\nare\nhereby\nconferred\non\nthe\nCommission:\n(a) to inquire into alleged infringements of Part II, and endeavour by\nconciliation to effect settlements of the matters alleged to constitute\nthose infringements;\nAct binds the Crown\n\"6. This Act binds the Crown in right of the Commonwealth, of each\nof the States, of the Northern Territory and of Norfolk Island, but nothing\nin this Act renders the Crown liable to be prosecuted for an offence.\".\nLand, housing and other accommodation"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2004a03367-sec-13-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2004a03367-sec-13"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2004a03367-sec-14",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "14 Section 14",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2004a03367#sec-14"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2004a03367.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2004a03367.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "Section 12 of the Principal Act is amended by adding at the end the\nfollowing sub-section:\n\"(3) Nothing in this section renders unlawful an act in relation to\naccommodation in a dwelling-house or flat, being accommodation shared or\nto be shared, in whole or in part, with the person who did the act or a\nperson on whose behalf the act was done or with a relative of either of\nthose persons.\".\nEmployment",
      "skos:definition": "Section 12 of the Principal Act is amended by adding at the end the\nfollowing sub-section:\n\"(3) Nothing in this section renders unlawful an act in relation to\naccommodation in a dwelling-house or flat, being accommodation shared or\nto be shared, in whole or in part, with the person who did the act or a\nperson on whose behalf the act was done or with a relative of either of\nthose persons.\".\nEmployment",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2004a03367-sec-14-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5ead04ebe337fa31c3f021e6016aa0681631eef4f8026008748497e043bdc86d",
      "skos:note": "Exempts certain acts from being unlawful in relation to shared accommodation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2004a03367#sec-14",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "14 Section 14",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 8,
      "values:originalText": "Section 12 of the Principal Act is amended by adding at the end the\nfollowing sub-section:\n\"(3) Nothing in this section renders unlawful an act in relation to\naccommodation in a dwelling-house or flat, being accommodation shared or\nto be shared, in whole or in part, with the person who did the act or a\nperson on whose behalf the act was done or with a relative of either of\nthose persons.\".\nEmployment"
    },
