      "dc:source": "c2004a03367.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "Section 15 of the Principal Act is amended by adding at the end the\nfollowing sub-section:\n\"(5) Nothing in this section renders unlawful an act in relation to\nemployment, or an application for employment, in a dwelling-house or flat\noccupied by the person who did the act or a person on whose behalf the\nact was done or by a relative of either of those persons.\".\nAdvertisements",
      "skos:definition": "Section 15 of the Principal Act is amended by adding at the end the\nfollowing sub-section:\n\"(5) Nothing in this section renders unlawful an act in relation to\nemployment, or an application for employment, in a dwelling-house or flat\noccupied by the person who did the act or a person on whose behalf the\nact was done or by a relative of either of those persons.\".\nAdvertisements",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2004a03367-sec-15-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2004a03367-sec-15-logic-deontic-1"
