      "dc:source": "c2004a03367.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "Section 16 of the Principal Act is amended by adding at the end \"or\nan act that would, but for sub-section 12(3) or 15(5), be unlawful by\nreason of section 12 or 15, as the case may be\".",
      "skos:definition": "Section 16 of the Principal Act is amended by adding at the end \"or\nan act that would, but for sub-section 12(3) or 15(5), be unlawful by\nreason of section 12 or 15, as the case may be\".",
