    {
      "@id": "concept:c2004a03367-sec-18",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "18 Section 18",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2004a03367#sec-18"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2004a03367.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2004a03367.pdf, p.22",
      "values:originalText": "Section 27 of the Principal Act is amended—\n(a) by omitting from sub-section (1) \"insult,\" and \"sections 21 and 22\nof;\n(b) by inserting after sub-section (1) the following penalty:\n\"Penalty for an offence against sub-section (1):\n(a) in the case of a natural person—$1,000; or\n(b) in the case of a body corporate—$5,000.\";\n(c) by omitting from paragraph (2) (g) \"section 22\" and substituting\n\"section 24c\"; and\n(d) by omitting \"Penalty: $500.\" and substituting the following penalty:\n\"Penalty for an offence against sub-section (2):\n(a) in the case of a natural person—$2,500 or imprisonment for\n3 months, or both; or\n(b) in the case of a body corporate—$10,000.\".\n\nHuman Rights and Equal Opportunity Commission\n(Transitional\nProvisions and Consequential Amendments)\nNo. 126, 1986",
      "skos:definition": "Section 27 of the Principal Act is amended—\n(a) by omitting from sub-section (1) \"insult,\" and \"sections 21 and 22\nof;\n(b) by inserting after sub-section (1) the following penalty:\n\"Penalty for an offence against sub-section (1):\n(a) in the case of a natural person—$1,000; or\n(b) in the case of a body corporate—$5,000.\";\n(c) by omitting from paragraph (2) (g) \"section 22\" and substituting\n\"section 24c\"; and\n(d) by omitting \"Penalty: $500.\" and substituting the following penalty:\n\"Penalty for an offence against sub-section (2):\n(a) in the case of a natural person—$2,500 or imprisonment for\n3 months, or both; or\n(b) in the case of a body corporate—$10,000.\".\n\nHuman Rights and Equal Opportunity Commission\n(Transitional\nProvisions and Consequential Amendments)\nNo. 126, 1986",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2004a03367-sec-18-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2004a03367-sec-18-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c0b8dddd9ebe3ca5f683e8d4ba7b630ed10d2d56321dcac5532499a7e32a3eaf",
      "skos:note": "Amends Section 27 of the Principal Act"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2004a03367#sec-18",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "18 Section 18",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 22,
      "values:originalText": "Section 27 of the Principal Act is amended—\n(a) by omitting from sub-section (1) \"insult,\" and \"sections 21 and 22\nof;\n(b) by inserting after sub-section (1) the following penalty:\n\"Penalty for an offence against sub-section (1):\n(a) in the case of a natural person—$1,000; or\n(b) in the case of a body corporate—$5,000.\";\n(c) by omitting from paragraph (2) (g) \"section 22\" and substituting\n\"section 24c\"; and\n(d) by omitting \"Penalty: $500.\" and substituting the following penalty:\n\"Penalty for an offence against sub-section (2):\n(a) in the case of a natural person—$2,500 or imprisonment for\n3 months, or both; or\n(b) in the case of a body corporate—$10,000.\".\n\nHuman Rights and Equal Opportunity Commission\n(Transitional\nProvisions and Consequential Amendments)\nNo. 126, 1986"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2004a03367-sec-18-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2004a03367-sec-18"
      },
