      "dc:source": "c2004a03367.pdf, p.26",
      "values:originalText": "Section 28 of the Principal Act is amended by omitting from subsection\n(2)\n\"Human\nRights Commission\"\n(wherever\noccurring)\nand\nsubstituting \"Commission\".\nAmendment of heading to Division 1 of Part VI",
