      "dc:source": "c2004a03367.pdf, p.30",
      "values:originalText": "The heading to Division 3 of Part III of the Principal Act is omitted\nand the following heading is substituted:\n\"Division 3—Inquiries by Human Rights and Equal Opportunity\nCommission\".",
      "skos:definition": "The heading to Division 3 of Part III of the Principal Act is omitted\nand the following heading is substituted:\n\"Division 3—Inquiries by Human Rights and Equal Opportunity\nCommission\".",
      "cml:asserts": [
