      },
      "dc:source": "c2004a03367.pdf, p.32",
      "values:originalText": "Section 92 of the Principal Act is amended by omitting from\nparagraph (2) (b) \"to an authority of a State in accordance with an\narrangement in force under section 11 of the Human\nRights\nCommission\nAct\n1981;\"\nand substituting \"to any person in accordance with an\narrangement in force under section 16 of the Human\nRights\nand\nEqual\nOpportunity\nCommission\nAct\n1986;\".\nTerms and conditions of appointment",
      "skos:definition": "Section 92 of the Principal Act is amended by omitting from\nparagraph (2) (b) \"to an authority of a State in accordance with an\narrangement in force under section 11 of the Human\nRights\nCommission\nAct\n1981;\"\nand substituting \"to any person in accordance with an\narrangement in force under section 16 of the Human\nRights\nand\nEqual\nOpportunity\nCommission\nAct\n1986;\".\nTerms and conditions of appointment",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2004a03367-sec-43-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2004a03367-sec-43-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1e6e4616d6215469a1f16ca4013e73796b5d96eee9d2e6b78f3431d2feaf3853",
      "skos:note": "Amend section 92 of the Principal Act regarding appointment arrangements."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2004a03367#sec-43",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "43 Section 43",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 32,
      "values:originalText": "Section 92 of the Principal Act is amended by omitting from\nparagraph (2) (b) \"to an authority of a State in accordance with an\narrangement in force under section 11 of the Human\nRights\nCommission\nAct\n1981;\"\nand substituting \"to any person in accordance with an\narrangement in force under section 16 of the Human\nRights\nand\nEqual\nOpportunity\nCommission\nAct\n1986;\".\nTerms and conditions of appointment"
    },
