      "dc:source": "c2004a03367.pdf, p.32",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Section 97 of the Principal Act is amended by omitting from\nsub-section (1) \"5 years\" and substituting \"7 years\".\n(2) The amendment made by sub-section (1) does not affect\nthe\nappointment, or the term of office, of the person who, immediately before\nthe commencement of this section, held office as the Sex Discrimination\nCommissioner.\nNon-disclosure of private information",
